# docker/app.Dockerfile and docker/stt.Dockerfile build with `context: ..`
# (the repo root) so they can COPY specific subdirs (app/, stt_service/).
# Without this file, `docker build` would try to tar up this repo's ~80GB+
# of model weights and leftover virtualenvs as build context first - none
# of which any image actually needs (models are volume-mounted at runtime,
# see docker-compose.yml).
.git
venv/
.venv*/
models/
archive/
remote_services/
data/
tests/
node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.jsonl
*.wav
*.mp3
.env
.env.local
